title: Analytics › Preventable denials chart
route: /analytics
intro: A horizontal bar chart of the denials the team could have fixed before sending, one bar for each reason. Its rows add up to the 'Preventable denials' tile. It is read-only. The reasons come from the same table as the denial reasons list, each tagged as fixable or not.
dir: TD
also: Demo only. A reason is fixable when it is thin or missing documentation, late notice, an incomplete certification or a duplicate request. Not fixable: units above criteria, a clinical disagreement on level of care, a partial approval without a reason, a payer's network error. Each payer's denials are spread over its reasons in fixed proportions, so every denial is counted once.
---
start s1 "Scroll to 'Preventable denials by reason'"
screen sc "Card 'Preventable denials by reason'\n'207 of 311 denials (67%) could be fixed before sending, this quarter'"

group gRows "Rows"
  screen r1 "Up to five bars, biggest first\n'Continued-stay evidence incomplete' 73\n'Missing recent therapy notes' 22\n'Recertification filed too late' 21\n'Retro-authorization window missed' 17\n'Step-down plan not named' 13"
  screen r2 "One lighter bar: '9 other fixable reasons' 61\nSo the bars add up to 207"
  screen r3 "Footnote: thin or missing documentation, late notice, an incomplete certification and a duplicate request count as fixable"
endgroup

group gScope "What changes it"
  process s2 "One payer: only that payer's fixable reasons\nCardinal shows three rows, no 'other' row"
  process s3 "One program: the fixable share moves\nResidential about 62%, IOP about 71%"
  process s4 "Another period: counts scale with decisions, the share stays about the same"
endgroup

decision q1 "Fewer than 20 denials in this view?"
screen h1 "'Not enough decisions yet. Figures based on fewer than 20 decisions stay hidden.'\nThe tile shows '-'"
process p1 "Hover and click do nothing on the bars\nTo open the denials behind a reason, use 'Common denial reasons by payer'"
process p2 "The tile, the bars, the Markdown file, the CSV and the printed page all use these rows"
goto g1 "Continues in: Analytics › Common denial reasons: open Denial Intelligence"
goto g2 "Continues in: Analytics › Monthly report › What the files contain"
end e1 "Chart read"

s1 --> sc --> r1 --> r2 --> r3 --> q1
sc --> s2 & s3 & s4
q1 -->|No| p2 --> e1
q1 -->|Yes| h1 --> e1
r3 -.-> p1
p1 --> g1
p2 -.-> g2
